    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While you aren't wearing any armor, your base Armor Class equals 10 plus your Dexterity and Charisma modifiers; you can use a Shield and still gain this benefit. You also gain proficiency in one of the following skills of your choice: Acrobatics, Intimidation, Performance, or Persuasion.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-zFsoshnXTsh36a5c\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Set your armor calculation to a custom formula, 10 + @abilities.dex.mod + @abilities.cha.mod, while you wear no armor.</p></section>",
